{
  "source": "EBOOT.BIN/battle_tutorial",
  "strings": [
    {
      "text": "The character will move in the\ndirection of  the analog stick.",
      "translation": "El personaje se moverá en la\ndirección del stick analógico.",
      "_offset": 1524688,
      "_length": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "Press × button while you point\nthe analog stick to run.",
      "translation": "Pulsa × junto al stick\nanalógico para correr.",
      "_offset": 1524752,
      "_length": 56
    },
    {
      "text": "Press ○ when next to a person   \nor an item to talk or examine.",
      "translation": "Pulsa ○ cerca de una persona\nu objeto para hablar o examinar.",
      "_offset": 1524816,
      "_length": 64
    },
    {
      "text": "You can have up to three Digimon\nin your party during battle.",
      "translation": "Puedes tener hasta tres Digimon\nen tu equipo en la batalla.",
      "_offset": 1524916,
      "_length": 61
    },
    {
      "text": "Normal Attack: Use the left or right arrow keys\nto select if there is more than one enemy.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1524980,
      "_length": 90
    },
    {
      "text": "Skill: Use SP to perform a powerful skill.\nThe effects and SP cost depend on the skill.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525080,
      "_length": 87
    },
    {
      "text": "Guard: Weakens damage sustained from\nenemies. This will last until the next turn.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525168,
      "_length": 81
    },
    {
      "text": "Item: Uses an item on hand. Items have\nvarious effects such as support and healing.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525252,
      "_length": 83
    },
    {
      "text": "Run: Allows you to run from battle.\nHowever, you may end up taking attacks.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525336,
      "_length": 75
    },
    {
      "text": "Strategy: Allows you to change the\nstrategy of your ally Digimon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525416,
      "_length": 65
    },
    {
      "text": "The Timeline will be in the\nlower area during battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525484,
      "_length": 53
    },
    {
      "text": "The Timeline indicates all of the Digimon\nwho are participating in the battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525544,
      "_length": 78
    },
    {
      "text": "The icons move to the left, and a Digimon\nwill act when their icon hits the edge.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525628,
      "_length": 81
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Digimon has acted,\ntheir icon will return to the right.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525712,
      "_length": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "Powerful skills push the icon away further,\ndelaying the Digimon's next turn.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525780,
      "_length": 77
    },
    {
      "text": "While attacking, you'll encounter the\nShock and Break effects.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525860,
      "_length": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "Shock causes the icon of the\naffected Digimon to stop moving.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1525936,
      "_length": 61
    },
    {
      "text": "Break returns the icon of the\naffected Digimon to the right.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526004,
      "_length": 60
    },
    {
      "text": "After clearing Episode, you'll return\nto the Episode Selection screen.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526192,
      "_length": 70
    },
    {
      "text": "Here, you can select an Episode to play next,\nor change your party member strategy.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526264,
      "_length": 83
    },
    {
      "text": "However, you can't play another Episode\nuntil you finish the one in progress.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526360,
      "_length": 77
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Episode Selection screen,\npress the SELECT button to save.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526444,
      "_length": 65
    },
    {
      "text": "By equipping obtained DigiPieces, your\nDigimon will become stronger.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526628,
      "_length": 68
    },
    {
      "text": "DigiPieces can raise stats, add\nnew skills, or have other effects.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526704,
      "_length": 66
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose a DigiPiece to equip and\nplace it in the central Skill Panel.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526792,
      "_length": 68
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot place two equipped\nDigiPieces so that they overlap.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526864,
      "_length": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the □ button to remove a DigiPiece.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526936,
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "The Skill Panel shape varies by Digimon.\nYou have limited space to fit the pieces.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1526996,
      "_length": 82
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Digimon reaches a certain\nlevel, their Skill Panel will grow.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527080,
      "_length": 68
    },
    {
      "text": "You can synthesize a new DigiPiece\nby collecting necessary materials.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527152,
      "_length": 69
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also obtain materials by\nbreaking down unwanted DigiPieces.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527228,
      "_length": 67
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also make items\nfrom the same materials.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527296,
      "_length": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "During the game, conversations between \ncharacters may deepen their bonds.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527456,
      "_length": 74
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the Bonding Rank, and\nhigher ranks will affect battles.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527532,
      "_length": 63
    },
    {
      "text": "If the Digimon of a character with a high \nBonding Rank will be acting next,",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527600,
      "_length": 76
    },
    {
      "text": "a powerful Bonding Combo support\nattack may be triggered.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527684,
      "_length": 57
    },
    {
      "text": "The higher the rank, the higher\nthe chance of a Bonding Combo.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527752,
      "_length": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "You can check the status of your Bonding\nRank in the status menu at any time.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527824,
      "_length": 77
    },
    {
      "text": "As the story progresses, the Digimon\nwill become able to evolve.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1527952,
      "_length": 64
    },
    {
      "text": "Evolution costs SP but stats will rise\nand the Digimon will be stronger.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528024,
      "_length": 72
    },
    {
      "text": "Status effects such as lowered stats\nor  poison will be removed.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528100,
      "_length": 64
    },
    {
      "text": "The skillset will also change to have\nmore powerful but SP-costly skills.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528168,
      "_length": 73
    },
    {
      "text": "There are two types of Episodes,\nMain and Sub-Episodes.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528284,
      "_length": 55
    },
    {
      "text": "A Sub-Episode with a yellow icon\nindicates limited time left to play it.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528352,
      "_length": 72
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuing with a Main Episode will\ncause the Sub-Episode to disappear.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528428,
      "_length": 71
    },
    {
      "text": "Press left or right at the\nEpisode Selection menu...",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528516,
      "_length": 52
    },
    {
      "text": "...to switch the type displayed\nbetween All, Main, or Sub.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528572,
      "_length": 58
    },
    {
      "text": "From the Episode Selection screen,\nyou can challenge the Digital Dungeon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528696,
      "_length": 73
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the L or R button at the Episode Selection\nscreen to switch to Dungeon Selection.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528780,
      "_length": 87
    },
    {
      "text": "The enemies vary by dungeon level and type.\nThis is a good place to earn EXP and items.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528872,
      "_length": 87
    },
    {
      "text": "The goal will move you to the next level.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1528960,
      "_length": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "Press ○ at the starting point marked EXIT\nto return to the Episode Selection screen.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529004,
      "_length": 85
    },
    {
      "text": "New dungeons will be added during the story\nprogress with stronger enemies within.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529096,
      "_length": 82
    },
    {
      "text": "Congratulations!\nYou have cleared all of the Main Episodes!",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529232,
      "_length": 59
    },
    {
      "text": "If you load the save data created after clearing\nthe game, you can start a New Game+.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529300,
      "_length": 85
    },
    {
      "text": "You will retain your levels from your cleared\ngame, along with your evolutions.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529388,
      "_length": 79
    },
    {
      "text": "Skill Panel size, obtained DigiPieces, items,\nmaterials, and recipes will also be retained.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529472,
      "_length": 91
    },
    {
      "text": "The last Digital Dungeon will also be\nadded to the Dungeon Selection.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529568,
      "_length": 69
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be very strong enemies here,\nbut you can find even more valuable items.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529640,
      "_length": 82
    },
    {
      "text": "During a New Game+, you can evolve\nto Omegamon during battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529776,
      "_length": 61
    },
    {
      "text": "When you have both WarGreymon &\nMetalGarurumon in your party during battle,",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529844,
      "_length": 75
    },
    {
      "text": "select Omegamon from the Evolve menu\nto fuse them into ultra-powerful Omegamon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1529920,
      "_length": 79
    },
    {
