      "text": "Evolving Omegamon",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1530228,
      "_length": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "An Adult Level Digimon that looks\nlike a chrysalis. To evolve from\nKeramon to more powerful Digimon,\nit temporarily gathers energy and\ntakes a chrysalis shape. It can't\nmove but is protected by a sturdy\nshell and attacks with the tentacles\non its back. Its Special Move, Data\nCrusher, destroys data with its\ntentacles.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1736953,
      "_length": 318
    },
    {
      "text": "Dragon Man",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1741650,
      "_length": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "What Gumdramon's evolution looks\nlike when free of the Kinkoji. It\nwears a special rubber battle armor\nwhich maximizes Gumdramon's special\ntrait, elasticity. Its defense\nimproved, its wings grew, and it\nflies at high speeds. It turns its\ntail into an anchor to grab its\nenemies and cut them to pieces. Its\nSpecial Move, Prism Garrett, cuts\nwith countless revolutions of light.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1741676,
      "_length": 376
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacks a random target 2 times.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1760761,
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacks a random target 4 times.",
      "translation": "",
      "_offset": 1760794,
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Restores a little HP every turn \n(enemy only).",
      "translation": "",
